    - Modus Tollens
    - Simplification
    - Addition
    expectedRule: Modus Ponens
  - kind: 3
    title: Formalize an Informal Explanation
    instructions: Place statements and matching rules on the numbered STEP and RULE
      pedestals.
    context: "Suppose P is true. Since P implies Q, Q follows. Since Q implies R,
      R follows.\nPremises: P, P \u2192 Q, Q \u2192 R. Conclusion: R."
    scrolls: []
